# stackguardian_workflow_step_template (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Templates and revisions

A workflow step template is a container. The runnable definition — the container image or source,
the inputs the step accepts, and how it executes — lives in a
[`stackguardian_workflow_step_template_revision`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/StackGuardian/stackguardian/latest/docs/resources/workflow_step_template_revision).

Steps are referenced from a workflow's `wf_steps_config.wf_step_template_id`.

