## Import

Import existing workflow step template

### Using Import block (terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_workflow_step_template.example
  id = "template-id"
}
```

### Using CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_workflow_step_template.example template-id
```
